  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="G1223">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G3739">this</char> <char style="w" strong="G156">reason</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">even [though]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3958">I suffer</char> <char style="w" strong="G3778">[as I do]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G235">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G1870">I am not ashamed</char>; <char style="w" strong="G1063">for</char> <char style="w" strong="G1492">I know</char> <char style="w" strong="G3739">whom</char> <char style="w" strong="G4100">I have believed</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G3982">I am convinced</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">He is</char> <char style="w" strong="G1415">able</char> <char style="w" strong="G5442">to guard</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">what</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3866">I have entrusted [to Him]</char><note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">1:12 </char><char style="ft">Or </char><char style="fqa">what He has entrusted to me</char></note> <char style="w" strong="G1519">for</char> <char style="w" strong="G1565">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2250">day</char>.</para>
  <para style="s1">Holding to Sound Teaching</para>
